│  • The _run_loop method is an async generator that manages the     │
│    event loop of the agent for a given invocation.                 │
│  • It takes messages (input messages), invocation_state, and an    │
│    optional structured_output_model.                               │
│  • It first invokes BeforeInvocationEvent passing only agent=self. │
