│ Reasoning:                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ The problem is that the BeforeInvocationEvent currently does not   │
│ expose the input messages, so hooks attached to it cannot view or  │
│ modify the input before it's appended or processed.                │
│                                                                    │
│ To fix this, we'll:                                                │
│                                                                    │
│  1 Modify BeforeInvocationEvent in src/strands/hooks/events.py to  │
│    accept an optional messages argument, defaulting to None. This  │
│    is backward-compatible.                                         │
│  2 In Agent._run_loop() in src/strands/agent/agent.py, when        │
│    calling await                                                   │
│    self.hooks.invoke_callbacks_async(BeforeInvocationEvent(agent=s │
│    elf)), pass the messages argument to the event constructor.     │
│  3 In Agent.structured_output_async(), move the construction of    │
│    temp_messages and the check for empty messages/prompt before    │
│    invoking the BeforeInvocationEvent. Then invoke the hook        │
│    passing the constructed temp_messages, so hooks have visibility │
│    and the chance to modify the input messages before invocation.  │
│                                                                    │
│ This achieves:                                                     │
│                                                                    │
│  • Exposing input messages on the BeforeInvocationEvent hook.      │
│  • Allow hook handlers to modify messages in-place for redaction   │
│    or validation.                                                  │
│  • Invocation of the hook after constructing the combined input    │
│    messages in structured_output_async, but before the model       │
│    invocation, as requested.                                       │
