│ The reasoning: The key requirement is to extend the                │
│ BeforeInvocationEvent to include the messages passed to the agent, │
│ so that hook providers can access and edit these messages early in │
│ the invocation lifecycle, before the messages are added to the     │
│ agent's state. We also want to move the raising of the             │
│ BeforeInvocationEvent in the structured_output_async method to     │
│ after the temp_messages are constructed, so hooks receive the full │
│ combined messages for inspection/redaction.                        │
│                                                                    │
