│  1 Modify the BeforeInvocationEvent class to add a messages        │
│    attribute (a list of messages) in its constructor.              │
│  2 Update all invoke_callbacks_async(BeforeInvocationEvent(...))   │
│    calls to pass the messages argument when available.             │
